[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]史实 vs 演义[/font][/b]


演义（毛本第109回 / 嘉靖本第220节）对徐质的描写大幅扩张：


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]情节差异[/font][/b]


[indent]1.  [color=#000000]演义虚构[/color]：徐质使用"开山大斧"，连败[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "廖化", "cat": "people"}]廖化[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "张翼", "cat": "people"}]张翼[/url][/color]（正史无此情节）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]2.  [color=#000000]死亡逻辑倒置[/color]：演义中徐质死在张嶷之前，而史实是徐质先斩张嶷，随后才被姜维所杀[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]3.  [color=#000000]战场背景改换[/color]：演义改为铁笼山运粮伏击战，正史为襄武城下的攻防战[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]4.  [color=#000000]死亡方式[/color]：演义中被姜维一枪刺倒坐骑，跌落被乱刀砍死；正史仅记"斩首"[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


